@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title History Importer: root, per-stream tasks and restart range

autonumber
participant "History Importer" as History
participant "Private Workspace API" as API
database "Workspace history tasks / mappings" as Tasks
participant "Zulip History API" as Zulip
database "Canonical state + outbox" as DB

History -> API : mTLS claim history root(account, boundary, selection)
API -> Tasks : authorize current certificate identity;\nthen account lease/fencing root
History -> Zulip : discover users/chats/topics/memberships
History -> API : ensure unmanaged identities + streams/topics/memberships
API -> DB : idempotent canonical mutations + outbox
History -> API : create immutable per-stream tasks
API -> Tasks : unique(account, boundary, range, stream)

note over Tasks
  Bridge-wide history pool default = 4.
  Accounts fair round-robin; within account newest stream first.
  All account workers share one rate limiter; realtime priority.
end note

par Stream A worker
  History -> API : claim stream A task
  loop topics/messages sequential, newest-first
    History -> Zulip : bounded keyset page
    History -> API : one idempotent message command
    API -> DB : MESSAGE + PLACEMENT + author binding/state + outbox
    History -> API : file/link/reaction or deferred reference
  end
  History -> API : complete stream A task
else Stream B worker (Until then configured limit)
  History -> API : claim stream B task
  History -> Zulip : independent stream range
  History -> API : same commands/provider keys
end

alt Zulip Retry-After For the account
  Zulip --> History : Retry-After
  History -> Tasks : pause account history until deadline
  note right of History
    Realtime resumes first; then fair history scheduling.
    Exact upper pool limit remains load-test decision.
  end note
end

alt crash/retry Until then completion stream B
  Tasks -> History : lease expires; re-claim stream B
  History -> Zulip : restart entire selected stream B range
  History -> API : same provider keys
  API --> History : duplicate/no-op for committed rows
  note right of History
    Message-level checkpoint v1 There is no.
    Completed stream A It won 't start again ..
  end note
end

History -> API : reconcile children/deferred/DLQ/totals
API -> Tasks : complete root after all gates

note over History,DB
  mTLS authenticates realm/provider/Bridge generation;
  account/task leases separately authorize current work.
  One . history worker I 'm on stream; topics/messages Inside in sequence.
  Zulip topic — The attribute message, Not separate parallel work unit.
  Files/reactions They're coming after. base message or durable deferred resolution.
  Bridge Does not perform Workspace projections/WebSocket delivery.
end note

@enduml
